00:21:08.210 --> 00:21:08.920
Last night, I was up until midnight studying the
fashion site that you told me about, Someya-san.

00:21:08.920 --> 00:21:10.420
Oh! Loli-chan's here.

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:12.580
Loli-chan, morning!

00:21:12.580 --> 00:21:13.580
Good morning.

00:21:13.580 --> 00:21:14.710
Oh... Good mo-

00:21:19.880 --> 00:21:24.710
Hey! You guys! Don't you be hurting
Loli-chan's feelings like that again!

00:21:25.080 --> 00:21:28.170
It's best if you think about
deoxyribonucleic acid, you know.

00:21:29.460 --> 00:21:31.790
Just what exactly happened?

00:21:32.170 --> 00:21:35.130
You look cute like a kokeshi doll.

00:21:35.130 --> 00:21:40.290
No! Grandma, please give me your bangs!

00:21:40.290 --> 00:21:43.580
There you go talking nonsense again. This child...

00:22:03.460 --> 00:22:07.830
Noisy and loud

00:22:08.130 --> 00:22:11.710
But also endearing

00:22:12.040 --> 00:22:15.920
The laughter from that day

00:22:15.920 --> 00:22:19.920
A story that can't be rewound

00:22:19.920 --> 00:22:23.790
The thing about youth is, it's always light and shadows

00:22:23.790 --> 00:22:25.830
Inside the darkness

00:22:25.830 --> 00:22:27.880
A shining inferior star

00:22:28.080 --> 00:22:31.580
Looking back are complicated

00:22:31.580 --> 00:22:36.040
Far too beautiful days

00:22:36.580 --> 00:22:45.580
Springtime has always passed by unexpectedly by then

00:22:45.580 --> 00:22:52.670
Your words reverberate in my heart

00:22:52.670 --> 00:23:01.170
Someday springtime will take it all away

00:23:01.170 --> 00:23:08.830
Until that day, being stupid is all right

00:23:09.170 --> 00:23:13.420
Because I'll run past it

00:23:17.630 --> 00:23:19.000
What?!

00:23:19.210 --> 00:23:20.710
Not fair!

00:23:19.210 --> 00:23:20.710
LIKE

00:23:20.710 --> 00:23:25.460
Stop being

00:23:20.710 --> 00:23:25.460
so clingy!

00:23:20.920 --> 00:23:23.790
What?! Long blond hair and sanpaku eyes.
Younger in age delinquent bottom!

00:23:23.790 --> 00:23:25.380
Black-haired glasses-wearing average Joe.

00:23:25.380 --> 00:23:27.210
Crybaby working adult member of society
and bullied child, who's a top?!

00:23:27.210 --> 00:23:28.920
That's playing dirty!

00:23:28.170 --> 00:23:40.080
In the middle of consuming something delicious.

00:23:28.920 --> 00:23:31.710
Is there anyone who wouldn't like that?
On the contrary! Thank you very much!

00:23:31.710 --> 00:23:34.420
Hurry up and get married!
Let me deposit gift money to you!

00:23:34.420 --> 00:23:36.420
For crying out loud, get buried in the same plot!

00:23:36.420 --> 00:23:40.080
I'll even buy the grave! Hurry up and
let me deposit money for you! Thank ya!
